	(text "3.3 V maximum; 1.1 kOhm +/-1%; initial Rmin = 1089 Ohm.\nI <= 3.3 / 1089 = 3.031 mA per input; four inputs <= 12.122 mA.\nNo LED Vf credit is needed for this bound. P(R) <= 10.0 mW.\nRoom-temperature bench only. Verify actual controller drive limits.\nBrightness and fit are unmeasured; no protection or level conversion."
